@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = replace-me
@idempotencyKey = order-demo-001

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc

### Create product (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ergonomic Keyboard",
  "price": 9800,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "stock": 10
}

### Create order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 1, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### Retry same request: should return the same logical result
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 1, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### Same key, different body: should conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}
  ]
}

### Read an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"user_request"}
